<div class="kmh-product-page kmh-section-padding">
  <div class="kmh-container">
    
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr)); gap: 3.5rem; align-items: start; margin-bottom: 5rem;">
      
      <!-- Gallery Column -->
      <div>
        <!-- Main Image Stage -->
        <div style="background: var(--kmh-bg-light); border-radius: var(--radius-card); border: 1px solid var(--kmh-border); overflow: hidden; position: relative; padding-top: 85%; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div style="position: absolute; inset:0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: radial-gradient(circle, #FFFFFF, var(--kmh-bg-light));">
            <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--kmh-navy)" stroke-width="1"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg>
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--kmh-navy); margin-top: 1rem; font-weight: 700;">Artisan 7.5QT High-Torque Stand Mixer</span>
          </div>
          
          <div style="position: absolute; top: 1rem; left: 1rem; display: flex; gap: 8px;">
            <span class="kmh-badge kmh-badge--bestseller">Flagship Model</span>
            <span class="kmh-badge kmh-badge--sale">Save $100</span>
          </div>

          <!-- AR Button Overlay -->
          <button class="kmh-btn kmh-btn-secondary kmh-btn-sm" onclick="document.querySelector('#KMH-AROverlay').classList.add('active'); document.querySelector('#KMH-ARModal').classList.add('active');" style="position: absolute; bottom: 1rem; right: 1rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(5px);">
            📱 View on Counter (3D AR)
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Gallery Thumbnail Bar -->
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem;">
          {% for i in (1..4) %}
            <div style="background: var(--kmh-bg-light); border: 2px solid {% if forloop.first %}var(--kmh-gold){% else %}var(--kmh-border){% endif %}; border-radius: 10px; height: 80px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer;">
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--kmh-navy);">View {{ i }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sticky Buy Box Column -->
      <div style="position: sticky; top: 100px;">
        <span style="color: var(--kmh-gold); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em;">KitchenMixHaven Signature Series</span>
        <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2.5rem; margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem; color: var(--kmh-navy);">
          Artisan 7.5QT Stand Mixer
        </h1>

        <!-- Rating & Stock Badge -->
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          <div class="kmh-rating" style="font-size: 1.1rem;">★★★★★ <strong style="color: var(--kmh-navy); margin-left: 4px;">4.9</strong></div>
          <span style="color: #64748B; font-size: 0.85rem;">(128 Verified Reviews)</span>
          <span class="kmh-badge" style="background: rgba(22,163,74,0.1); color: var(--kmh-success); border: 1px solid var(--kmh-success);">In Stock</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Pricing -->
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          <span style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--kmh-navy);">$499.00</span>
          <span style="font-size: 1.3rem; text-decoration: line-through; color: #94A3B8;">$599.00</span>
          <span class="kmh-badge kmh-badge--sale" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">17% OFF</span>
        </div>

        <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.8rem;">
          Commercial 750W high-torque motor engineered for tough sourdough doughs, enriched brioche, and high-volume bakery whipping. Die-cast all-metal housing with 5-year full replacement warranty.
        </p>

        <!-- Variant Swatches -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          <label style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">
            Select Finish: <span style="color: var(--kmh-gold);" id="KMH-ColorName">Obsidian Black</span>
          </label>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0F172A; border: 2px solid var(--kmh-gold); cursor: pointer;" title="Obsidian Black"></div>
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #E2E8F0; border: 1px solid var(--kmh-border); cursor: pointer;" title="Brushed Stainless"></div>
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #991B1B; border: 1px solid var(--kmh-border); cursor: pointer;" title="Empire Red"></div>
            <div style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D4AF37; border: 1px solid var(--kmh-border); cursor: pointer;" title="Luxury Gold Edition"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quantity & Add Buttons -->
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--kmh-border); border-radius: var(--radius-button); padding: 0 1rem; background: #FFFFFF;">
            <button class="kmh-qty-btn kmh-qty-minus" style="border: none; background: none; font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer;">-</button>
            <input type="number" value="1" style="width: 40px; text-align: center; border: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem;" readonly>
            <button class="kmh-qty-btn kmh-qty-plus" style="border: none; background: none; font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer;">+</button>
          </div>

          <button class="kmh-btn kmh-btn-primary" style="flex-grow: 1;" onclick="KMH_OpenCart()">
            Add to Cart &bull; $499
          </button>
          
          <button class="kmh-icon-btn" data-wishlist-toggle data-product-id="main-appliance" style="width: 50px; height: 50px;">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l8.72-8.72 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 000-7.78z"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>

        <button class="kmh-btn kmh-btn-gold kmh-btn-full" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          Buy Now with Apple Pay / Shop Pay
        </button>

        <!-- Attachment Fitment Finder -->
        {% render 'compatibility-finder' %}

        <!-- Shipping Info Cards -->
        <div style="background: var(--kmh-bg-light); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--kmh-border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #475569; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          <div>🚚 <strong>Free Express Delivery</strong> (2-3 Days)</div>
          <div>🛡️ <strong>5-Year Full Warranty</strong></div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Product Accordion Specifications & Info -->
    <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Product Specifications & Details</h2>
      
      <div class="kmh-accordion active">
        <button class="kmh-accordion__trigger">
          <span>Overview & Key Features</span>
          <span>↓</span>
        </button>
        <div class="kmh-accordion__content">
          <p>The Artisan 7.5QT Stand Mixer represents the pinnacle of home baking engineering. Built with a heavy-duty 750W planetary drive, 10 variable electronic speed settings, and a tilt-head lock design, it easily handles heavy bread dough, cookie doughs, and light soufflés.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kmh-accordion">
        <button class="kmh-accordion__trigger">
          <span>Technical Specifications (Motor, Bowl, Dimensions)</span>
          <span>↓</span>
        </button>
        <div class="kmh-accordion__content">
          <ul style="list-style: disc; margin-left: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            <li><strong>Motor Power:</strong> 750 Watts High-Torque Pure Copper Motor</li>
            <li><strong>Bowl Volume:</strong> 7.5 Quarts (7.1 Liters) Brushed Stainless Steel</li>
            <li><strong>Speeds:</strong> 10 Variable Speeds with Soft-Start Pulse Control</li>
            <li><strong>Body Material:</strong> Die-Cast Zinc & Steel Frame</li>
            <li><strong>Weight:</strong> 28.5 lbs (12.9 kg) for maximum tabletop stability</li>
            <li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 16.5" H x 11.2" W x 14.8" D</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kmh-accordion">
        <button class="kmh-accordion__trigger">
          <span>5-Year Luxury Warranty & 30-Day Returns</span>
          <span>↓</span>
        </button>
        <div class="kmh-accordion__content">
          <p>Every KitchenMixHaven mixer includes our 5-Year Full Manufacturer Warranty covering all internal gears, electronics, and motor parts. If you are not completely satisfied within 30 days of purchase, return it for a full refund with free return shipping.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Main Product",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
